Episode 01: The Falling Man

Opening

A body was discovered in a remote field outside the city.

Police ruled it an accidental fall.

Detective D. Torque was not convinced.

Investigation

The victim carried a backpack.

Most investigators ignored it.

Torque examined the straps and fabric.

The backpack was actually a parachute.

Someone had fallen from the sky.

Clues

* Damaged parachute straps
* Unidentified aircraft records
* Missing flight logs

Resolution

Torque proved the victim had been pushed from an aircraft.

The death was murder, not an accident.

Case Closed.
